# Third-party AI design skills, installed with the commands in
# ops/HANDOFF-TO-CODEX.md. They are pinned by hash in skills-lock.json, so
# they are reinstalled rather than vendored: ~5.7 MB of somebody else's code
# does not belong in a public repo whose whole job is a small static site —
# and everything here would otherwise be published to the live site.
.agents/
.claude/skills/

# npm scratch, if a tool ever leaves it behind
node_modules/
